<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill reinstates biotech stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill reinstates biotech stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday analyst Eric Hecht had reinstated coverage of three biotechnology stocks.</p>
<p>-- Amgen Inc was reinstated with a rating of near- and long-term accumulate, Biogen Inc with a rating of near-term accumulate and long-term buy and Chiron Corp as near-term neutral and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- On Friday, Amgen closed at 61-1/8, Biogen at 49-1/4 and Chiron at 20-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
